Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:56:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(macos): window-point hit testing, paste fallback,
 sheet click guard

- hitTestElement receives window points from every caller but converted
  them as screenshot pixels: wrong probe point whenever the screenshot is
  scaled, and an error when the screenshot was skipped.
- type_text method=paste falls back to keystrokes when the app ignores
  Cmd+V (background apps), and any type_text without a known field says
  the result is unverified.
- Element clicks are refused while a sheet covers the window, instead of
  pressing a sheet button that sits over the element.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
